# The mkinitcpio archiso hooks are vendored directly into
# airootfs/usr/lib/initcpio (copied from mkinitcpio-archiso) because the
# package is not available in the Artix repositories. Without these hooks the
# initramfs is built with the HOOKS list in
# airootfs/etc/mkinitcpio.conf.d/archiso.conf silently skipped and the boot
# drops to an emergency shell with "mounting '' on real root".
